 {"networkAttributes":[{"n":"__foo","v":"bar"}, {"n":"author","v":"Rudolf T. Pillich, PhD"}, {"n":"description","v":"<p>This network shows the interactions between projects funded under the <a href=\"https://itcr.cancer.gov/\" target=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Informatics Technology for Cancer Research</a> (ITCR) program and the bioinformatic tools they create.</p><p>Nodes and Edges in the graphic can be selected to show information about the tools, their integration, status of the collaboration and &#34;Evidence&#34; of its completion.<br/>Edges that provide an &#34;Evidence&#34; for tools integration are thicker compared to the others.</p><p>The tool size is determined by the Connectivity Score, that is calculated by assigning 1 point for &#34;Ongoing&#34; (blue) connection, or 3 points for &#34;Existing&#34; (orange) connection.<br/><br/>New tools added to the map in the latest annual update are colored in green. A thick black border indicates tools with active ITCR awards as of August 2025.</p><p><b>Edge Color legend</b>:<br/>Orange solid &gt; Existing connections (completed)<br/>Blue solid &gt; Ongoing connections (work in progress)<br/>Grey dashed &gt;  Proposed connections<br/>Selected items &gt; Bright yellow</p>"}, {"n":"version","v":"20250815"}, {"n":"@context","v":"{\"nih\":\"https://reporter.nih.gov/project-details/\"}"}, {"n":"labels","v":"NIH, NCI, ITCR"}, {"n":"reference","v":"https://itcr.cancer.gov/"}, {"n":"rights","v":"Waiver-No rights reserved (CC0)"}, {"n":"name","v":"ITCR Connectivity Map"}, {"n":"networkType","v":"Connectivity Map"}]},
