h) TCIA"}, {"po":191,"n":"Evidence","v":"https://cbica.github.io/CaPTk/ITCR_Connectivity.html#itr_tcia_idc"}, {"po":191,"n":"Why?","v":"Enriching TCIA data collections with segmentations and radiomic features. Robustness analysis on radiomic features on TCIA dat"}, {"po":18,"n":"Status","v":"Ongoing"}, {"po":18,"n":"Suggested By","v":"Christos Davatzikos"}, {"po":18,"n":"name","v":"CaPTK (Connected with) XNAT"}, {"po":18,"n":"Why?","v":"Integrate CaPTk pipelines into XNAT workflows"}, {"po":17,"n":"Status","v":"Proposed"}, {"po":17,"n":"Suggested By","v":"Christos Davatzikos"}, {"po":17,"n":"name","v":"CaPTK (Connected with) OHIF"}, {"po":17,"n":"Why?","v":"Integrate segmentation and radiomic features of CaPTk into LesionTracker"}, {"po":16,"n":"Status","v":"Exists"}, {"po":16,"n":"Suggested By","v":"Andrey Fedorov"}, {"po":16,"n":"name","v":"CaPTK (Connected with) dcmqi"}, {"po":16,"n":"Evidence","v":"https://cbica.github.io/CaPTk/ITCR_Connectivity.html#itcr_dcmqi"}, {"po":16,"n":"Why?","v":"Conversion of the analysis results into structured and standardized format"}, {"po":15,"n":"Status","v":"Ongoing"}, {"po":15,"n":"Suggested By","v":"Christos Davatzikos"}, {"po":15,"n":"name","v":"CaPTK (Connected with) 3D Slicer"}, {"po":15,"n":"Why?","v":"Make CaPTk functionality available as Slicer Plugin"}, {"po":180,"n":"Status","v":"Ongoing"}, {"po":180,"n":"Suggested By","v":"Samuel Gamboa"}, {"po":180,"n":"name","v":"TIES (Connected to) Bioconductor"}, {"po":180,"n":"Why?","v":"The BiocOncoTK package lists the TIES as one of the key resource centers of interest for providing communication infrastructure to support extraction and analysis of well-structured, self-describing data"}, {"po":89,"n":"Status","v":"Exists"}, {"po":89,"n":"Suggested By","v":"Michael J. Becich"}, {"po":89,"n":"name","v":"TIES (Connected with) Globus"}, {"po":89,"n":"Why?","v":"Move from Globus Toolkit to Globus Auth for federated ID management"}, {"po":88,"n":"Status","v":"Proposed"}, {"po":88,"n